[摘录2]
Therefore, angle at P is x = 26°, angle at T is 2x = 52°. 

[摘录3]
Therefore, angle PQR is the angle between the positive x-axis (QR) and the line PQ. 

[摘录4]
Therefore, angle PQR is 180° - arctan(10/7). 

[摘录5]
Therefore, angle between PQ and positive x-axis is 180° - 55° = 125°, so angle PQR is 125°? Wait, but that contradicts the previous thought that it was 26°. 

[摘录6]
Therefore, angle between PQ and PT is the same as angle between PQ and QR, which is angle PQR. 

[摘录7]
Therefore, angle PQR is equal to x°, which is 26°, but according to coordinates, it is approximately 125°, which is not 26°. 

[摘录8]
Therefore, the angle at P between PT and PQ is x = 26°, and the angle at Q between PQ and QR is angle PQR. 
